      "description": "Get ready for the ultimate wrist-racing experience!\nControl your mini car using the Apple Watch’s Digital Crown in this addictive arcade-style racing game. Twist to steer, dodge tricky obstacles, and collect shiny coins to boost your score. The longer you survive, the faster it gets – how far can you go?\nWhether you're waiting in line or just want a quick adrenaline rush, this game is perfect for quick plays anytime, anywhere.\n\nFeatures:\n• Intuitive Digital Crown controls\n• Endless gameplay with increasing difficulty\n• Collect coins and beat your high score\n• Simple, fun, and incredibly addictive\n• Optimized for Apple Watch\n\nStart racing now — your wrist is the steering wheel!",
